<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fff4df">
    <title>OnMangeQuoi - Hors ligne</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: "Avenir Next", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        align-items: center;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 18% 12%, rgba(232, 79, 53, .18), transparent 20rem),
          radial-gradient(circle at 82% 18%, rgba(255, 209, 102, .32), transparent 22rem),
          #fff4df;
        color: #101119;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: max(1.5rem, env(safe-area-inset-top)) 1.25rem max(1.5rem, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
      }
      main {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .88);
        border: 1px solid rgba(16, 17, 25, .12);
        border-radius: 2rem;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(67, 49, 21, .14);
        max-width: 32rem;
        padding: 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        width: 100%;
      }
      img { height: 5rem; width: 5rem; }
      .icon { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
      .kicker { color: #627a31; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h1 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 9vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1; margin: 1rem 0; }
      p { color: #5f604f; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 26rem; }
      a {
        background: #101119;
        border-radius: 1rem;
        color: white;
        display: inline-flex;
        font-weight: 900;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        min-height: 3rem;
        padding: .85rem 1.25rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        width: 100%;
      }
      a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #e84f35; outline-offset: 4px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="icon"><img src="/icon.svg" alt=""></div>
      <p class="kicker">Cuisine déconnectée</p>
      <h1>Le réseau fait une pause</h1>
      <p>Vos données restent protégées. Reconnectez-vous pour retrouver vos plans, votre stock et votre liste de courses à jour.</p>
      <a href="/">Réessayer</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
